@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Registro
# @name registerUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Torres",
  "email": "ana@example.com",
  "password": "una frase de acceso segura"
}

### Registro intentando ser admin (debe crear un user)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Intruso",
  "email": "intruso@example.com",
  "password": "una frase de acceso segura",
  "role": "admin"
}

### Login
# @name loginUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@example.com",
  "password": "una frase de acceso segura"
}

### Token de Ana
@userToken = {{loginUser.response.body.accessToken}}

### Perfil
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Perfil sin token (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me

### Perfil con token mal formado (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer esto.no.es.un.token